          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ikakaia m'bonyi nguma wabonya kaung'a usemanyire, na kunona malaghiro ghamu BWANA Mlungu wake orelaghirieghe ghisakebonywa, nao ukaie mkosi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ukameria kuwonyerwa kaung'a yake, uchareda ifunyo ja fwandi iseko na itiko; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nao uchawikiria mkonu ghwake aighu ya iyo fwandi, na kuibwagha imbiri ya BWANA andu aho vizongona vekorwa vibwaghilwaghwa. Ni kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niko mkohani uchawada bagha imu ya kizongona kwa wundu ghwa kaung'a na chala chake, na kuishinga aighu ya mbembe ra madhabahu ekoria vizongona; na bagha yasigharika uchaidia nandonyi ya madhabahu ghekoria vizongona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mavuda ghake ghose uchaghikora aighu ya madhabahu, sa iji koni orebonyereghe kwa vizongona va mapatano. Uchabonya wupatanisho kwa wundu ghwake, nao uchafuilwa wughoma.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
