        {
          "text": "Na mkohani uchawada imu ya bagha yake na chala chake na kuishinga aighu ya iro mbembe ra madhabahu ekoria vizongona na bagha yasigharika uchaidia nandonyi ya madhabahu. ",
          "type": "text",
